#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e6c8a0463cd57bc01d221de879a2ee15d8d24e70b83ff130a544b77a912b6a5
#. default-sha256: f9289a2eae9261aa3a2a010fe33639dd9dc7026e7ba610b30d92c2a71859b53c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As cartas persistentes da Garota de Cabelos Brancos não "
"melhoraram nada–⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫mas simplesmente atiçaram as chamas do mal-entendido."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 262ef11451103042e2f5bb2b6ef7b09105953938142172403a7972b6bfef5ec8
#. default-sha256: cb696ae7eb70c45f55aacdabebe72b162f00483f6f19ba59a97a95b91f3e0ddc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Isso continuou por vários meses. ⟪k:1⟫Embora lá fora o sol brilhasse com o calor suave da "
"primavera, os ventos frios e amargos do inverno ainda sopravam implacavelmente entre Jacopo e sua "
"esposa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e77f935d078c3b1a07677434c5714fcd81f6540dc23ce15f4a593de58721b1f4
#. default-sha256: 5ae3484795373decc6b2dec641a202e89227186f8e07d3367db44628d2cb768c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sem permissão para sair de seu barracão e sem receber resposta às suas cartas, a única fonte "
"de informação da Garota de Cabelos Brancos era Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0e47edac095c1746277f350267c3d54dd4ecca85f6eada7b5b96f898799c1d4
#. default-sha256: 63fab86566de745b65e384192efc9ea40d2d78b04465711990a91fa010cd1f36
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Semana após semana, suas circunstâncias permaneceram as mesmas, mas outra coisa estava "
"começando a mostrar sinais de mudança:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acf65948a0cb07ece01077bb679ebd4de181e8d5627ae0b87dead0577b015e9e
#. default-sha256: 7d955295307a755ca0fb1862c547a94382021288ca1b9d87d85c3b6af5671ebb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Seu estado mental."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2f3aa87fd4bf702171f8d08931c1f48b662b1fab80ce3a87af80f1a3fb2d33d
#. default-sha256: 32b34690af99061210ddd11d31f0f4241f90a1b1efa5f12e42493105bbbe14b2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫É inútil, Madame.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Nesse ponto, você só "
"está perdendo seu tempo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d9b39c7fe9fae8d7d6804b83c15ed9512372db1d252ab8cd0f8dd8de2de9727
#. default-sha256: 0b39a776e6d1e32ae58f393c4d182c5f1b53fa854dbf320de0d64aa369c55df1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu o vi jogar sua carta na lareira."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41170d571073f95af1baccb6ea5efc7c55671facd4efda6c17c7f34add187ebc
#. default-sha256: 1b11206b0403d067976039cfddf8474133dfe7fb5831c6505b035aeb6b359ea9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele não vai ler nada do que você escrever,⟪k:1⟫não importa o quanto de sua alma você despeje "
"nela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 383f37cb6d6b39d8c993124666ef9d9f7fc5d51338c54b58cad9a53f3fb4d2d2
#. default-sha256: 95b2afbfa27ea08a54629fa6ebc8de2425ca8b83e20efd2d5f2efdcf45d1fdca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele se preocupa mais com dinheiro e trabalho do que com amor. ⟪k:1⟫Esse é o tipo de homem "
"que ele é."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2096bd7ca0e917aea05e6a18270c242917a0e037f5281407eaed9be172ef48d8
#. default-sha256: 40759e733bef49fc925f66dca7d26f886a5dc8656d854b4e8eae590601933cc6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Just give up and file for divorce already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Apenas desista e peça o divórcio de uma vez."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27a2da4a9195a3a5fff54959e61ad10ab481348b53ff357e723e0d4da097ecf2
